  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Soil 304.01 Certificate. An applicant for certification as a certified soil scientist or certified wetland scientist, who has met all the requirements and has paid all of the fees, shall be issued a certificate by the OPLC authorizing the practice of soil science or wetlands science.\n\nSource. #4676, eff 9-20-89, EXPIRED: 9-20-95\n\nNew. #6232, eff 4-26-96; ss by #6881, eff 11-13-98; ss by #8621, eff 5-2-06; ss and renumbered by #9886-A, eff 3-11-11 (formerly Soil 305.01); EXPIRED 3-11-19\n\nNew. #14019, eff 9-6-24 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Soil 300)",
